r=A.hV("Page 1\nUsage Policy for Users of the Aqarat Application\nThis policy has been established to protect users, real estate offices, investment companies, and the\nAqarat application itself. Using the application or website means accepting this policy.\n1. Purpose of This Policy\nThis policy is intended to help users understand what is allowed and what is not allowed on the platform,\nhow information is used, and under what circumstances an account or request may be restricted or\nsuspended.\n2. What the Aqarat Application Is and Is Not\nThe Aqarat application is a digital platform for searching for properties, viewing listings and projects, and\nconnecting with real estate offices and investment companies. The Aqarat application is a communication\nintermediary and is not a sales party. It does not guarantee the completion or accuracy of every\ntransaction.\n3. Proper Conduct on the Platform\nUsers must behave in an organized and appropriate manner on the platform. Sending fake requests, using\nfalse accounts, making threats, insulting others, or harassing parties and other users is prohibited.\n4. Information Provided by Users\nAny information a user submits through forms or through their account must be accurate and belong to the\nuser. Sending another person's phone number without permission or providing false information may result\nin account suspension.\n5. Policy on Visit and Purchase Requests\nAll requests must be serious and made for a genuine purpose. Sending fake requests or making\npurposeless test requests in order to burden real estate offices is prohibited.\n6. Follow and Notifications\nUsers may follow the profiles of Aqarat offices or investment companies to receive notifications about\nnewly published items. The Aqarat application will make efforts to send updates and offers through\nnotifications in the best possible way; however, it does not guarantee that all notifications will be delivered\nin every circumstance.\n7. Privacy and Information Policy\nThe Aqarat application uses users' information to manage services and deliver requests to the relevant\nparties. Completing forms means agreeing that the necessary information may be sent to an office or\ninvestment company for response purposes.\n8. Business and Profile Protection Policy\nUsers must not use the profiles of parties to harass them, submit false reports, or damage their reputation.\nAny improper use may result in account restrictions.\n9. Content and Reference Policy\nImages, designs, and platform and party content are provided only for normal viewing and use by users.\nCopying or using them for harmful purposes is not permitted.\n10. Security Policy\nUsers must not use brute-force methods, malware, phishing, bots, scraping, hacking, or any unlawful\nattempt to break or disrupt the system. Any attempt of this kind may result in account closure and legal\naction.",o,o,o,o,o,o,o,A.hl(l,o,m,A.bI().$3$color$fontSize$fontWeight(A.at().gaW(),14,B.l).x,r,0),B.aW,o,o)
